          "reasoning": "The message creates artificial panic by claiming immediate account deactivation within 2 hours, coercing the recipient into submitting sensitive KYC identity documents via an insecure unverified link.",
          "details": "Linguistic markers match high-probability social engineering scam corpus.",
          "latency_ms": 680
